      "content": "His \"steady\" nature might suggest he thrives on predictable high performance, which could benefit stability in a fast-paced environment. You'll need to specifically probe in the interview to gauge how he responds to rapid, chaotic change or outright failure. Ask situational questions that require immediate, high-stakes, high-risk pivots to truly test for an aggressive drive. This will help determine if his steadiness is thoughtful execution or resistance to your company's pace.",
