    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that, but I don't really have time for a \"let's see how he handles it\" approach. I need a Director who hits the ground running and matches our intensity from day one. If I'm being honest, 'steady' usually sounds like 'slow' to me. Is there anything in his interview transcripts that shows he actually has that killer instinct, or are we just hoping he can keep up?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
