      "content": "Reviewing his transcripts for instances where he championed aggressive, decisive action or pushed back against stagnation is key. Look for language that indicates proactivity, risk-taking, or a contrarian approach rather than just methodical planning. If the transcripts mostly reflect optimization and methodical scaling, you may be right to worry about his ability to match your required intensity immediately. You might need a short, intense simulation exercise instead of just relying on past interview responses.",
